<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Yukiyú Botanical Circuit | Cybercore Biofísica & Santuario Botánico</title>
  
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,600;1,400;1,600&family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-void: #040706;
      --bg-surface: #080d0b;
      --bg-glass: rgba(12, 20, 16, 0.72);
      --bg-glass-card: rgba(15, 26, 21, 0.68);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(22, 38, 30, 0.85);
      
      --neon-cyan: #00f0ff;
      --neon-cyan-glow: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
      --neon-mint: #00ffa3;
      --neon-mint-glow: rgba(0, 255, 163, 0.35);
      --neon-amber: #ff9e00;
      --neon-amber-glow: rgba(255, 158, 0, 0.45);
      
      --border-subtle: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.14);
      --border-hover: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.45);
      --border-amber: rgba(255, 158, 0, 0.3);
      
      --text-main: #f0f7f4;
      --text-dim: #94a89e;
      --text-mono: #617b6e;
      
      --font-tech: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      --font-botanical: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-void);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 75%, rgba(255, 158, 0, 0.09) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(0, 255, 163, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }

    .cyber-grid {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
      background-image: 
        linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 255, 163, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 55px 55px; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
    }

    .scanline {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) 50%);
      background-size: 100% 4px; z-index: 999; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.55;
    }

    .container { max-width: 1260px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }

    .hud-ticker {
      background: rgba(3, 6, 5, 0.96); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-mono);
      padding: 0.55rem 0; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .ticker-content { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem; }
    .ticker-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; }
    .pulse-indicator {
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--neon-mint);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-mint); animation: pulse 1.8s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(1.25); }
    }

    header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(5, 9, 7, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12); z-index: 100; padding: 1.15rem 0;
    }

    .nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .brand-group { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .brand-logo-frame {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 1.5px solid var(--neon-cyan); border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      position: relative; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25), inset 0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
    }
    .brand-logo-frame svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: none; stroke: var(--neon-mint); stroke-width: 2; }
    .brand-logo-frame::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; width: 5px; height: 5px; top: -2px; right: -2px;
      background: var(--neon-amber); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--neon-amber);
    }
    .brand-text h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 1.18rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .brand-text span { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--neon-cyan); text-transform: uppercase; }

    nav ul { display: flex; gap: 2.2rem; list-style: none; align-items: center; }
    nav a {
      color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.76rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    nav a:hover { color: var(--neon-cyan); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6); }

    .btn-dyno-trigger {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; padding: 0.58rem 1.3rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--neon-amber); border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255, 158, 0, 0.08);
      color: var(--neon-amber); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: all 0.25s ease; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-dyno-trigger:hover { background: var(--neon-amber); color: #000; box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-amber-glow); }

    .hero { padding: 6rem 0 5rem; position: relative; }
    .hero-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 3.5rem; align-items: center; }
    .hero-meta {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.95rem;
      border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25);
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--neon-cyan); letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.12;
      font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 30%, #bad5ca 70%, var(--neon-mint) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .hero p.lead { font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.72; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; max-width: 640px; }
    .hero p.lead em { font-family: var(--font-botanical); font-size: 1.35rem; color: #e4ede8; font-style: italic; }

    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-cyan {
      padding: 0.88rem 2.1rem; background: var(--neon-cyan); color: #000; font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
      border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan); border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.25s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35);
    }
    .btn-cyan:hover { background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-glass {
      padding: 0.88rem 2.1rem; background: var(--bg-glass); color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }
    .btn-glass:hover { border-color: var(--neon-amber); color: var(--neon-amber); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .telemetry-cluster {
      background: rgba(9, 15, 12, 0.85); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.8rem; backdrop-filter: blur(20px); box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), inset 0 0 35px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03);
    }
    .cluster-top {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem;
    }
    .cluster-mode-switch { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
    .mode-btn {
      flex: 1; padding: 0.45rem 0.2rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: var(--text-dim); border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .mode-btn.active, .mode-btn:hover { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12); border-color: var(--neon-cyan); color: var(--neon-cyan); }

    .tachometer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
    .gauge-card { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-cyan); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; }
    .gauge-card.amber { border-left-color: var(--neon-amber); }
    .gauge-head { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-mono); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .gauge-num { font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    .gauge-num span { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--neon-mint); }
    .bar-bg { margin-top: 0.65rem; height: 5px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
    .bar-level {
      height: 100%; width: 82%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-mint));
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-mint); transition: width 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .bar-level.amber { width: 78%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-amber), #ff5500); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-amber); }

    .telemetry-feed {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-dim);
    }
    .feed-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }

    section { padding: 6rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
    .sec-kicker { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--neon-cyan); letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
    .sec-title { font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.2vw, 2.7rem); color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    .sec-desc { color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 720px; font-size: 1.02rem; margin-bottom: 3.8rem; }

    .circuit-track-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
    .sector-frame {
      background: var(--bg-glass-card); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2.4rem; position: relative; backdrop-filter: blur(14px); transition: all 0.35s ease; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sector-frame:hover { background: var(--bg-card-hover); border-color: var(--border-hover); transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); }
    .sector-tag { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--neon-amber); letter-spacing: 0.15em; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
    .sector-title { font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 1.4rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .sector-botanical-name { font-family: var(--font-botanical); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--neon-mint); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; display: block; }
    .sector-text { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.72; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
    .sector-badges { display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .badge-pill {
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18); color: var(--neon-cyan); border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .sanctuary-wrapper {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 52, 38, 0.45) 0%, rgba(6, 12, 10, 0.95) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 163, 0.3); border-radius: 14px; padding: 3.8rem; margin-top: 4.5rem;
    }
    .sanctuary-content { max-width: 880px; }
    .sanctuary-quote {
      font-family: var(--font-botanical); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.35; color: #eef7f2; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-mint); padding-left: 1.8rem;
    }
    .sanctuary-byline { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--neon-mint); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .outpost-container {
      background: rgba(12, 18, 15, 0.6); border: 1px dashed var(--border-amber); border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2.8rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .outpost-title { font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--neon-amber); line-height: 1.25; }
    .outpost-title span { display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-mono); letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
    .outpost-body { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.96rem; line-height: 1.75; }

    footer { background: #020403; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12); padding: 4.5rem 0 2.8rem; text-align: center; }
    .footer-logo { font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 1.35rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.28em; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .footer-sub { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-mono); letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }
    .footer-legal { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); padding-top: 2rem; }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero-layout, .circuit-track-grid, .outpost-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      nav ul { display: none; }
      .sanctuary-wrapper { padding: 2.2rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="cyber-grid"></div>
  <div class="scanline"></div>

  <!-- HUD Ribbon -->
  <div class="hud-ticker">
    <div class="container ticker-content">
      <div class="ticker-badge">
        <span class="pulse-indicator"></span>
        <span>BORIKÉN CORDILLERA // LAT 18°18'N, LON 66°42'W // ELEV 780M</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        SISTEMA: <span style="color: var(--neon-mint); font-weight: 700;">CIRCUITO BOTÁNICO ACTIVO</span> // Eh: <span id="ticker-eh">+384 mV</span> // KC: <span style="color: var(--neon-amber);">$246.80</span>
      </div>
      <div>NODO DE RESISTENCIA & CALIBRACIÓN BIOLÓGICA</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <header>
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="brand-group">
        <div class="brand-logo-frame">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <h2>Yukiyú</h2>
          <span>Botanical Circuit</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#sectores">Sectores</a></li>
          <li><a href="#telemetria">Telemetría Dyno</a></li>
          <li><a href="#santuario">Loa a la Tierra</a></li>
          <li><a href="#soberania">Outpost Corsario</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <a href="#telemetria" class="btn-dyno-trigger">
        <span>[ Calibrar Dyno ]</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-layout">
        <div>
          <div class="hero-meta">
            <span>[ PROTOCOLO YBC-01 ]</span> • Biofísica de Precisión & Resiliencia Caribeña
          </div>
          <h1>El invernadero de cristal bajo el pulso del neón.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Donde la fisiología vegetal de vanguardia se calibra con la telemetría de un motor de competición y el respeto silencioso de <em>Loa a la Tierra</em>. Un santuario biofísico fundado desde la cordillera de Puerto Rico.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#sectores" class="btn-cyan">Explorar los 4 Sectores</a>
            <a href="#telemetria" class="btn-glass">Simular Telemetría</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="telemetry-cluster" id="telemetria">
          <div class="cluster-top">
            <span style="letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--text-mono);">INSTRUMENT CLUSTER // V4.2</span>
            <span style="color: var(--neon-mint); font-weight: 700;">LIVE TELEMETRY</span>
          </div>

          <div class="cluster-mode-switch">
            <button class="mode-btn active" onclick="setMode('optimo')">Régimen Óptimo</button>
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="setMode('lluvia')">Cosecha Lluvia</button>
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="setMode('estres')">Estrés Hídrico</button>
          </div>

          <div class="tachometer-grid">
            <div class="gauge-card">
              <div class="gauge-head">POTENCIAL REDOX (Eh)</div>
              <div class="gauge-num" id="val-eh">+384 <span>mV</span></div>
              <div class="bar-bg">
                <div class="bar-level" id="bar-eh" style="width: 82%;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gauge-card amber">
              <div class="gauge-head">PAR BIOLÓGICO Si/N</div>
              <div class="gauge-num" id="val-par">9.4 <span>Bar</span></div>
              <div class="bar-bg">
                <div class="bar-level amber" id="bar-par" style="width: 78%;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="telemetry-feed">
            <div class="feed-line">
              <span>CONDUCTIVIDAD IÓNICA (EC):</span>
              <span id="val-ec" style="color: var(--neon-cyan); font-weight: 700;">1.42 dS/m</span>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-line">
              <span>CANALES Lsi1/Lsi2 (SILICIO):</span>
              <span id="val-lsi" style="color: var(--neon-mint); font-weight: 700;">VIGOR PLENO (100%)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-line">
              <span>VOLTAJE COLECTOR ATMOSFÉRICO:</span>
              <span id="val-volt" style="color: var(--neon-amber); font-weight: 700;">1.18 Vdc</span>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-line">
              <span>FUTUROS COFFEE 'C' (KC):</span>
              <span style="color: #fff; font-weight: 700;">$246.80 / cwt</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 Sectores -->
  <section id="sectores">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="sec-kicker">// 01. Circuito Botánico</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Los Cuatro Sectores del Trazado</h2>
      <p class="sec-desc">
        La experiencia no es una lista de servicios convencionales; es un recorrido técnico y sensorial que une el suelo vivo, la alta cocina cafetalera y la soberanía del productor.
      </p>

      <div class="circuit-track-grid">
        <div class="sector-frame">
          <span class="sector-tag">SECTOR 01 // EL CONSERVATORIO DE CRISTAL</span>
          <h3 class="sector-title">Biotecnología & Magnecultura</h3>
          <span class="sector-botanical-name">Phytologia Radix & Electromagnetismus</span>
          <p class="sector-text">
            El invernadero de cristal modular donde la botánica se estudia desde primeros principios: transporte de ácido monosilícico por acuaporinas radiculares, biofísica del aerénquima, enmiendas húmicas de Leonardita y modulación de campos eléctricos atmosféricos para inducir resistencia sistémica sin agroquímicos.
          </p>
          <div class="sector-badges">
            <span class="badge-pill">Fisiología del Silicio</span>
            <span class="badge-pill">Doble Muralla Caspary</span>
            <span class="badge-pill">Leonardita / Biochar</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sector-frame">
          <span class="sector-tag">SECTOR 02 // EL BANCO DE PRUEBAS</span>
          <h3 class="sector-title">Café de Sombra & Microlotes</h3>
          <span class="sector-botanical-name">Coffea arabica ssp. Typica & Borbón</span>
          <p class="sector-text">
            Cosecha de altura cultivada en las laderas de Maricao y Utuado. Tratada como combustible de alta precisión: telemetría térmica en cada curva de tueste, extracción con agua dinamizada magnéticamente y trazabilidad directa de la finca a la taza sin intermediarios comerciales.
          </p>
          <div class="sector-badges">
